                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cb6312e-f14d-4e2c-9d57-091d7a3fff94",
                                                "sense_id": "5cce5c6d-d3f7-350b-a080-1a820a1408a5",
                                                "text": "[W]e say it is unreasonable, that this [the bread or host of the Eucharist] should be changed into flesh, […] into that body of Christ, which is in heaven; he remaining there, and being whole and impassible, and unfrangible, this, we say, is unreasonable and impossible: […]"
